I am desperately searching for a termcap entry for a Delta Data
5000 (alias Telterm 2).  I have constructed one that nearly works,
but have been unable to instruct vi how to scroll correctly.  In
addition, while it almost must be my imagination, the boolean
'xr', which should make vi reverse scroll correctly, seems to do
absolutely nothing.  The termcap manual makes mystical references to
variables which are supposed to work for a Delta, and, indeed, there
is a totally incorrect entry in our version of termcap.  While I
realize how unlikely it is that anybody still uses deltas, if there
is some unlucky vi wizard who can help me out, I'd very much
appreciate it.

